    <text><paragraph>Vital signs recorded on 1987-05-26; see the referring visit&apos;s Vital Signs section. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Vascular</td><td>Femoral pulses present and equal; popliteal and foot pulses absent on the right; foot pulses faint on the left; no bruits over the abdomen</td></tr><tr><td>Feet</td><td>Warm; slow capillary refill on the right; no pallor on elevation or dependent rubor; skin intact; calluses and hammer toes; no ulcer or gangrene</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Protective sensation intact to the monofilament</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

